# Normalise line endings so the repo always stores LF, whatever OS a
# contributor is on. Without this, a Windows checkout commits CRLF and every
# later diff from a Linux/macOS contributor shows the whole file as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Documentation
*.md   text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf

# Images — never touch these
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
